	(text "Weapon hardware enable: W_VCC = +VDRV only when WEAPON_EN (GP9) AND ARM link closed.  Q49 (from the gate node) and Q50 (from ARM_N) hold the AT32 in reset while disabled,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 214.63 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
